        <body>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Intel Clear&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;In the September IQR release, we have enabled...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Intel Clear&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Automatic updates and @mentions into chatter when a Customer or Field Revision is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Intel Clear&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;More details can be found on the &quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/ww38-2021-release-update/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(46, 116, 181);&quot;&gt;What&apos;s New&lt;/a&gt;&quot; page.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Candara, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</body>
